OrderPlaced → PaymentReceived → StockReserved → OrderShipped
🔁 If StockReserved fails, it emits StockFailed, and PaymentService listens to that to refund.

🎮 2. Orchestration Saga (Command-based)
A Saga orchestrator tells each service what to do.

